OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARacing scene at crash death site
OL,4,Acriticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Thornton said the sound of
OL,7,F"screeching tyres" drew him out of his
OL,8,Fhome on Sunday night, fearing there had
OL,9,Fbeen another collision, only to
OL,10,Fdiscover a film crew were working on
OL,11,Fthe road where Catlin died.
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire Council has apologised
OL,14,Fand pledged to review its procedures
OL,15,Ffollowing the blunder.
